{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36808","headline":"大梁从事居汜水 · 罗隐","name":"大梁从事居汜水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前年帝里望行尘，记得仙家第四人。\n泉暖旧谙龙偃息，露寒初见鹤精神。\n歌声上榻梁园晚，梦遶残钟汜水春。\n知有箧中编集在，只应从此是经纶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36808.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36808","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}